      "created_at": "2014-02-20T16:19:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm sure the answer to this is very obvious, but this situation led to some headscratching in a game last night:</p><p>When Akash'Bhuta's Mountainous Carapace is destroyed, does it do the full 11 damage (if I'm remembering the HP right) or does the DR it provides survive long enough to reduce the damage to Akash'Bhuta to 10?&nbsp; Assume she only has one Mountainous Carapace in play.&nbsp;</p>",
