      "created_at": "2014-02-20T17:44:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've always played it that she takes the full 11, not 10. But after reading Ronway's post.... his way seems to make more sense technical-rules-wise. Thematically, though, isn't it like hitting a part of Akash so much that her skin blows off? Such that the damage is coming form it being blown off, and the carapace can't really protect akash from anything if it is the thing getting destroyed...</p>",
